### 4. Sleepy Test
**Test:** `ProcessOrder_AsyncNotification_IsSent` (line 91)
**Risk:** `Thread.Sleep(2000)` is non-deterministic — too short on a slow machine → flaky red; always too slow for a fast one. Adds 2 seconds of dead wait to every suite run.

```csharp
// ❌ Current
processor.ProcessOrderAsync(order);
Thread.Sleep(2000);
Assert.IsTrue(_email.WasNotificationSent(order.Id));
```

```csharp
// ✅ Fix — await the async operation; or poll with a timeout
var result = await processor.ProcessOrderAsync(order);
Assert.IsTrue(_email.WasNotificationSent(order.Id));
```

