### 7. Sensitive Equality
**Test:** `GetOrderSummary_ReturnsFormattedString` (line 123)
**Risk:** Calling `.ToString()` ties the test to the exact string representation. Any formatting change (currency symbol, spacing, pluralization) breaks the test even though the data is correct.

```csharp
// ❌ Current
Assert.AreEqual("Order ORD-001: 1 item(s), Total: $99.99", summary.ToString());
```

```csharp
// ✅ Fix — assert on structured properties
Assert.AreEqual("ORD-001", summary.OrderId);
Assert.AreEqual(1, summary.ItemCount);
Assert.AreEqual(99.99m, summary.Total);
```

